description:
Responsibilities：




 1\. Responsible for the energy storage project development in the India, actively expanding overseas markets;




 2\. Conduct research on market product planning requirements, share the information with




 relevant support departments, develop solutions, and assist in designing products suitable for the market;




 3\. Develop global partnerships and establish a robust upstream and downstream business ecosystem in BESS industry, including developing partnerships with local developers, consultants, grid




 companies and financial facilities.




 4\. Building the company's brand and competitiveness;










 Job Requirements:




 1\. Bachelor's degree or above, with a major in battery, engineering, or electrical power preferred;




 Priority will be given to candidates with over 2\-3 years of experience in market development for




 photovoltaic inverters, photovoltaic modules, and energy storage;




 2\.Candidates familiar with Asia Pacific cultures and with overseas study, living, or work experience will be preferred;




 3\. Fluent in English.
